{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:f0634c7a78a1d64a341a5653b15405e8ef4b904455962c268e16132b685d2c2b",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:956c8307ea3b3f3f1af6a5e6c25a4cd78b858cde7e63f4bc62dd2b495108bc10",
      "text": "借音符传递祝贺之心",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce7976472a260532e8fa7a0fd244e144137effd4bdd80645608a1348d697a7c3",
      "text": "圭的生日将近，\n丽正在为该如何庆祝而烦恼。\n与制作人商量后，决定去询问圭本人\n生日有没有想要的东西，\n但是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b09bcd6e18d66980a219b2c252065efab172f9d4ca056860b35d17112afe537",
      "text": "第2话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:956c8307ea3b3f3f1af6a5e6c25a4cd78b858cde7e63f4bc62dd2b495108bc10",
      "text": "借音符传递祝贺之心",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_a:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:12244af430d099c1bd0f2bbacee79a9ea4176ffcffcb986b80b9b9aa25ce4168",
      "text": "阁下，能占用一点时间吗？\n我有些事想商量……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_a:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:66e079b46a13ad0a3a55a094d54bd61330365ecb8201a71740b52c720bf4d18e",
      "text": "好啊，什么事呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_a:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0b338773d4d895f8c588a0532d43dfa9427009743739c8395d6c948da33fc16b",
      "text": "都筑先生的生日，马上就要到了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_a:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb021b96720a49ef8be6cafe7dee420cfb7c019d38dd2b6c0c42453e78c52bbe",
      "text": "毕竟是一年一度的生日。作为同一组合的\n成员，我想做些什么来庆祝一下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_a:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7ca86d0448b30857deeff5097cb6704dc37d5d743644e879bafa32367fc4132",
      "text": "但是，我对这种活动\n并不怎么熟悉。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_a:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d7eda840b6faed3218d797118c12cc28c8cf50efd23cfe233025dbefe07f329",
      "text": "虽然家人曾为我庆祝过生日，但要为其他人\n庆祝的话，我就不知道该做些什么好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_a:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8542fc2baca39f3ee8615b86dc8e363a099eed291e09a4c7d938544b6ce23524",
      "text": "原来如此……难得的机会，\n要不去问问圭先生本人如何呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_a:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2916f845357f77942bfef4de1d8f41b3d9aa89366a499d1cd7822eee4a3802e",
      "text": "我也考虑过，但直接去问的话\n就称不上惊喜了，所以……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_a:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4dad727a65dc4fc4dcde727b8b3fa5b6eb76b244cd0037a45e487ef40c78a7ba",
      "text": "不过，确实这样更能保证\n办一场能让他高兴的庆祝呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_a:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b295921b52edd4fce3981372aa8aecfbfa21a051fdf6869af7dbf939e1b9d57",
      "text": "谢谢你。我打算这就去跟都筑先生谈谈。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_b:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:debad253884d521f3e2b99719c60cf1397210364465224d384bb4d6c887b4bd5",
      "text": "都筑先生，早上好。\n我有件事想请教您。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_b:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a27ed6e7e91fa61e1ee02847123d855c10269071c3a7d1fef352f6cdb73726cc",
      "text": "早上好，丽先生。\n这么郑重其事，怎么了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_b:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bfad96fef739d828325ca6461aee44eea79eec7e771ab2ce99c3423a5f4b607",
      "text": "那个……生日的时候，\n您有什么想要的东西吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_b:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e377ef9b078d80e1df3765fd67e4ecf0afac71d0b78f57bafdfa44a45a3f9e6b",
      "text": "……那是指，谁的生日？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_b:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a5e2ba8c4f550ae1a0b3c61d1f9f9249b1dfa042f94935fd1ddc5fe50fcbeff",
      "text": "还能是谁，当然是都筑先生的生日了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_b:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8de88fb26385b9f5ae17015e739610d696fe7f9a85cda48d57a74d7675bd873c",
      "text": "已经到这个时候了吗。完全忘记了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_b:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c2790d7a7b25f167b1f1d54f776a29adae1fe635d9a957cffefb4a247efd6076",
      "text": "想要的东西啊，让我想想……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_b:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2c7a742522d1391ee0b60c93965acc9b36ff42990dd53ade983de5df0418129",
      "text": "什么都想不到呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_b:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6190252515da4e9e8638a4c41cf889bd1e0cf10d9a0e039488d1cea8fb6bc6d7",
      "text": "要是没有想要的东西，\n希望我为您做些什么也是可以的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_b:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:550972694b5662cdf3ab17584d26cc976517b65246f9929e1cde3afba390b80d",
      "text": "虽然我能做到的事情并不算多。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_b:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de5b504ba2ff0a3d02d22fa5e0ef20673f311f19368646951f34c697c1fec2f6",
      "text": "希望丽先生做的事，吗……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_c:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eb052888cf9943fa87c5133bf9cb66a0218af6f14e613e7cbd5c41f7659ce835",
      "text": "啊，那我想到了一个。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_c:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:898a7914d906bc5e94cdf02b2138254a88734d4903bf760e4e74b6841f97bc62",
      "text": "真的吗？\n请务必告诉我。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_c:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb472d1767680f66fec8524c6209abdede2f1bcfd747a2d09bedd2b85a48808f",
      "text": "生日那天，想听丽先生的演奏呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_c:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36bdd9b476728891bc1dc0da72f8dac4a8970082dd9e02580e005fa81cc8934e",
      "text": "……我的演奏，吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_c:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a801b7ec8cecc65d199f14aa7bdd4ab4a44e3c2df460bfb3ab8137125bbe445",
      "text": "嗯。只要丽先生不介意的话。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_c:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9517dc61b036a9736f9c43030945c2f00384a9e1167ec8da4b8e38346704f71e",
      "text": "原来如此……我知道了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_c:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97886ee25acbb2b160324095c4fa60a97a36fa0d555bb2bc834b9ee7f3f6f617",
      "text": "既然都筑先生这么说，我乐意之至。\n我会做好准备的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_c:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca8ce57a0c96daa1ab4a24a8d71e2718900bec89d1e6109518051e6ef3a1141d",
      "text": "呵呵，谢谢你。\n感觉会是一个美好的生日呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_c:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fbea8f8eeda871f7836ef6f8a9f1ef4fcc3ddbaef8c81d2cbdce787e197b1986",
      "text": "为了能让都筑先生感到高兴，\n在当天之前我会勤加练习的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_c:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:31f27ba4c1c29bed9e80b699f1ad50d1fd78e615310a1a1cbf9ee73a4a99b8ea",
      "text": "嗯，我很期待哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_d:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b43d0c03f4bab451991bd37f7530c9d0580799484f4050ceb1d96f67c82da49",
      "text": "～～～♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_d:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4bec7494fba5e5cd928df73a4f5df38f5a6b93e7fb94ab923d65d5567791808b",
      "text": "圭先生，看起来挺高兴的呢。\n遇到什么好事了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_d:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00682e95014ba768b0566b51cda7c13afd2d4102bed4ce52754df35dff70973f",
      "text": "丽先生问我，生日那天\n想听什么曲子呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_d:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e5211555134dc057c6ee6d5be83a9dc34744a9fb5245379dbee2dc7627ab0db",
      "text": "原来是这样啊。\n您点了什么样的曲子呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_d:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9079f1acad308863009e04f54dff423b849fb44a225ca45c4353dac31822ee2b",
      "text": "我回答说，只要是丽先生挑选的都好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_d:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a087b0d3390cd1a9e958f4099cb5602bc14585773211b6df516fdc969843837",
      "text": "究竟会选什么样的曲子呢，\n真想早点听到啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_d:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5425833270c198da39e29c3fd362027b784bd4d148c4a6d07cf411e195152b3",
      "text": "期待的事情又多了一件呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_d:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3edd8b50eb75b55f4e2e82b9f015fdc2d65eed3572ff6a9fa0dd0330ab2d3883",
      "text": "呵呵，是啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_d:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b21c412a07caab85e29c54b13f55eb465b8f517957251a309e40007d209f5d21",
      "text": "距离我的生日……还有10天吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_d:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:18fdde94fcabffd77a2795efadc0ccdfe30c404946221d103d13db7cbb37b3d0",
      "text": "直到当天都没有忘记自己的生日，\n说不定还是头一遭呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_e:cmd-000015:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0caba00123987c65267cb553eff1c391af5c1350a25058166325804f0b0c7b21",
      "text": "生日当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_e:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:382d4ef1e28dc4129caf51f7a3dd60f17040b4113c3988c5c590559ce7fd8304",
      "text": "……曲毕。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_e:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f208f35b4aa4f622ca1f20fce27822942d18ea5908cf4a1c255d073cefbcd7c",
      "text": "是维瓦尔第呢。太美妙了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_e:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:707ef38f7c7d2823517b603e54165a5dd4a322dbfb6f910ba3f370ef2161e08b",
      "text": "是的。《四季》中的\n第一首《春》，第一乐章《快板》……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_e:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c1e1fd7ce557215052d8d12b68b3c215dfa2e92c186ec99d3a162a859d6e2de",
      "text": "因为这是一首宣告春日来临的乐曲，\n我认为非常适合都筑先生的生日，便选了这首。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_e:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:67c9da8760e2ae8e73d5ba9e440c386d9562296682b4950994b181b39deeb329",
      "text": "欢快悦动、满怀祝福的声音……\n度过了一段非常惬意的时光呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_e:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc82c0397ba41e1c81d45c51eb7c0552ce4feaf1ffb52a10d9444271af007bf9",
      "text": "谢谢你美妙的演奏，丽先生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_e:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb2c011fcf813017cbbf3e6285ae3a592bf166e0288e9b77fdfe737b09541d10",
      "text": "圭先生，祝您生日快乐。\n难得的好日子，我还准备了蛋糕。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_e:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:88da75f52235ef069cd2da6a8e24185befe195f50a05dc5f330668709ecc5055",
      "text": "虽然特意选了比较小份的……\n不嫌弃的话请尝尝看吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_e:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dfa751d187251562ccad238979085825642f9f26ee2c01de59e9369c6947670f",
      "text": "谢谢。既然是来自二位的心意，\n我会努力吃完的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
